      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2170_Task4" name="System auto-versions every planogram change (date, user, zones affected, SKUs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-versions every planogram change (date, user, zones affected, SKUs added/removed, reason); Planner reviews the change log weekly; a 24-month history is maintained per store for audit and rollback
Responsible (R): System / Merch Planner
Accountable (A): IT System Admin
Duration: 1–2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2170_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
