        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-394 (ensure controlled execution — Planogram Design &amp; Category Space Allocation (PA-55.1).) | - CTL-394 (capex-approval — links to VS-40 / W21 for major layout changes); operational: COO + VP Merch sign-off on the layout and the execution timing
Owner: Store Design Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
