    <bpmn:process id="W_W2172" name="W2172. Category Adjacency Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly review cycle — Category Adjacency Planning
Frequency: Quarterly; 13 categories
Volume: ~13 adjacency reviews/quarter
Owner: Merchandising Planner
Participants: Merch Planner, Category Mgr, Store Design Mgr
Source: workflow W2172 — Category Adjacency Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2172_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2172_Lane1" name="Merchandising Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2172_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2172_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2172_Lane2" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2172_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2172_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2172_Start4" name="Quarterly review cycle — Category Adjacency Planning">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2172_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2172_Task5" name="Planner reviews the adjacency map and the cross-category purchase patterns from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Planner reviews the adjacency map and the cross-category purchase patterns from POS basket data (which categories co-purchase and should be adjacent); proposes the changes for logical complementary placement (e.g., tiles adjacent to thin-set/grout; paint adjacent to brushes/rollers)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 6–8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2172_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2172_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2172_Task6" name="Category Manager approves; incorporates into the next seasonal planogram…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Manager approves; incorporates into the next seasonal planogram refresh (W2166) so the adjacency change lands in a coordinated reset, not piecemeal
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2172_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2172_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2172_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2172_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-394 (ensure controlled execution — Planogram Design &amp; Category Space Allocation (PA-55.1).) | - Operational: Category Manager + Store Design Manager joint sign-off on adjacency changes
Owner: Merchandising Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
