        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-394 (ensure controlled execution — Planogram Design &amp; Category Space Allocation (PA-55.1).) | - CTL-394 (budget/forecast accuracy — links to VS-17 / W26); operational: Finance Manager sign-off on the methodology
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
